# Copy this file to .env (gitignored - see repo root .gitignore's bare
# ".env" rule) and fill in real values from your Grafana Cloud account's
# Cloud Access Policy. apply-alloy-secret.sh sources .env automatically if
# present, and now refuses to run at all if the three *_PASSWORD values are
# missing - no more silent placeholder fallback. Never commit the real .env -
# only this .example file is tracked.

